&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cross-functional teams such as Product, Legal, Operations, Risk, and Treasury.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in regulatory interpretation, advisory, and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to regulatory audits, inspections, or supervisory interactions is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex regulations into practical, implementable business solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
